===Proper noun===
'''Србијанац''' {{m}} ({{p}}: '''Србијанци''')

#An inhabitant of [[Central Serbia]] (Serbia excluding Vojvodina); a citizen of [[Serbia]] (''not necessarily of [[Serb]] ethnicity''); a [[Serb]]. The term is usually considered as derogatory. Noun [[Srbin]] (or [[Srpkinja]] in the feminine case) is to be used instead.

